OL,3,GNEWSAGirl faces six-month recovery
OL,4,Aafter 'freak accident' bus crash on
OL,5,ATurkey holiday
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe mother of a girl who was crushed by
OL,8,Fa bus and trapped after it flipped
OL,9,Fwhile the family were on their first
OL,10,Fever holiday abroad has urged people
OL,11,Fnot to "scrimp" on travel insurance.
OL,13,FEmma Williams, from Llanrug in north
OL,14,FWales, said her 12-year-old daughter
OL,15,FGreta was left with a fractured sacrum
OL,16,Fand pelvis, after the bus lost control
OL,17,Fand fell on its side while overtaking
OL,18,Fanother vehicle during an excursion, in
OL,19,FAlanya, Turkey, last month.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,432,430,260,140,0,100
