OL,3,GNEWSAGirl faces six-month recovery
OL,4,Aafter 'freak accident' bus crash on
OL,5,ATurkey holiday
OL,6,
OL,7,FShe said Greta, whose care and
OL,8,Ftransport back to the UK was covered by
OL,9,Ftheir travel insurance policy, faced a
OL,10,Fsix-month journey to full recovery.
OL,12,FThe BBC has approached the company
OL,13,Fwhich put on the excursion, Tony
OL,14,FMontana Excursions, for comment.
